				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## How to read these pages\n\nEach component page answers three questions:\n\n- what it is\n- when it is useful\n- what documentation or examples should exist next\n\nThe placeholders are intentionally short. They should make the component easy to recognise without pretending the full docs are finished.\n"
